  "title": "Hearty Herbal Canadian Chicken Stew",
  "description": "A high-protein and juicy stew featuring herbal flavors, made with vegetable stock and a yuzu-cure, served on a wooden board. This dish is a cozy representation of Canadian cuisine.",
